flowchart TB
  PJ[Unified project]
  PJ --> SG[Scene graph: pages, layers, components]
  PJ --> TG[Timeline graph: tracks, clips, keyframes]
  PJ --> AS[Assets and proxies]
  SG --> PV[Interactive preview]
  TG --> PV
  SG --> RP[Render plan]
  TG --> RP
  RP --> IM[Image/document renderer]
  RP --> FF[Video/audio worker]
  IM --> AR[Artifacts]
  FF --> AR
